From: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7996: validate airtime event array stride

The upstream ALL_STA bounds check must recognize the downstream airtime
array before the event reaches its existing handler. Use the actual airtime
element size and retain the native station-count clamp for truncated events.

Signed-off-by: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-5.6-sol
Index: mt76/mt7996/mcu.c
===================================================================
--- mt76.orig/mt7996/mcu.c	2026-10-09 19:30:01.589667386 -0700
+++ mt76/mt7996/mcu.c	2026-10-09 19:30:19.181033280 -0700
@@ -928,6 +928,9 @@
 	case UNI_ALL_STA_TXRX_MSDU_COUNT:
 		elem_size = sizeof(res->msdu_cnt[0]);
 		break;
+	case UNI_ALL_STA_TXRX_AIR_TIME:
+		elem_size = sizeof(res->airtime[0]);
+		break;
 	default:
 		return;
 	}
